\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Main panel, Qwen3-1.7B, $\lambda =0.05$, averaged over both draw directions (400 states). Tokens include the paid draft. Differences are against confidence, with 90\% whole-question intervals holding fitted actions fixed. Lift is accuracy minus random escalation at the same token cost, in percentage points. $^\dagger $Derived from the reported accuracy and tokens. Rows without an interval were not bootstrapped against confidence.}}{3}{table.caption.5}\protected@file@percent }
